OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers fear losing quiet life
OL,4,Ato 'monstrosity' meat processing plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a small south Scotland
OL,7,Fvillage say they fear losing their
OL,8,F"quiet life" after work started on a
OL,9,F#24m meat processing plant nearby.
OL,11,FThe Pickstock Telford development at
OL,12,FEcclefechan promises about 90 jobs in a
OL,13,Frural area as well as help to reduce
OL,14,Ffood miles.
OL,16,FThe company has said that at its
OL,17,Ffactory in England "you wouldn't even
OL,18,Fknow there was a food processing plant
OL,19,Fon site".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
