OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers fear losing quiet life
OL,4,Ato 'monstrosity' meat processing plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut villagers remain concerned about
OL,7,Fthe potential for traffic, odours,
OL,8,Fnoise and pollution from the plant
OL,9,Fwhich should be up and running by 2029.
